  "invariants": [
    "Stateless catalog derives from current executable registrations; relevant initial schemas and at most three search hits become callable without granting permission.",
    "Discovery exposure derives from completed same-turn action receipts, terminal observation identity, tool call identity, current interface and registration/policy digest. Revoked or replaced registrations invalidate old discovery.",
    "Real local SSE -> xsAI -> production background runner -> actual SQLite life effect and runtime settlement -> one operation -> one final reply. Search can continue directly to the operation.",
